# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Dream of the Red Chamber: the two Jia households (Ning and Rong) and the Jia clan.

Fields (see data_hl.py for the rest)
  grp:    roster group: ning / rong / kin / serv / out
  debut:  chapter in which the person first appears or is formally introduced
  dies:   chapter of death (or of the first report of it), or None
  camps:  [(chapter, household[, zh label, en label]), ...]  household from that chapter on; the optional label says
          what happened (married off, thrown out, took vows)
  bio:    the story in chapters 1-80 (Cao Xueqin's text); citations "(第N回)" / "(ch. N)" become chapter chips
  late:   the story in chapters 81-120 (the Cheng-Gao continuation), shown only when the last forty chapters are on
  born:   birth family of a woman who married into the household, as (zh, en)
"""
