    bio=("宁国公的孙子，中过进士，却一心想做神仙，把世袭的官让儿子贾珍袭了，自己住在都中城外，“和道士们胡羼”，烧丹炼汞，家里的事一概不管(第2回)。他过生日也不肯回府，对来请他的贾珍说“我是清净惯了的”，不愿受儿孙们磕头(第10回)。第六十三回他吞服自己炼的金丹而死，“肚中坚硬似铁，面皮嘴唇烧的紫绛皱裂”；宁府办丧事，尤氏把继母尤老娘和两个妹妹接来照应，二尤的故事由此开始。",
         "Grandson of the first Duke of Ning, he passed the highest examination but cares only for becoming an immortal: he has handed his hereditary rank to his son Jia Zhen and lives outside the city with Taoist priests, refining elixirs and ignoring the family (ch. 2). He will not even come home for his birthday, telling Jia Zhen, who comes to invite him, that he is used to quiet and wants no kowtowing (ch. 10). In chapter 63 he dies after swallowing an elixir of his own making, his belly hard as iron and his lips burnt and cracked. For the funeral Madam You brings in her stepmother and two stepsisters — the start of the You sisters’ story."),
