    bio=("贾珍的妻子，性情随和，说话没有多少分量。宁府梅花开时，她治酒请荣府的人赏花，宝玉就在这天睡在了秦可卿房里(第5回)。秦可卿病重，她为媳妇发愁(第10回)；秦氏死时她正犯了胃疼旧疾，贾珍只好请凤姐来协理宁国府(第13回)。贾敬死后她独自料理丧事，接来继母和两个妹妹(第63回)。贾琏偷娶尤二姐的事败露，凤姐大闹宁国府，滚到她怀里哭骂，啐了她一脸(第68回)。抄检大观园后，惜春执意不要入画，还要和宁府断绝来往，姑嫂吵了一场(第74回)。",
         "Jia Zhen’s wife, easy-going and without much say. When the plum trees bloom she gives a party for the Rong household, the day Baoyu naps in Qin Keqing’s room (ch. 5). She frets over her daughter-in-law’s illness (ch. 10), and is laid up with her old stomach trouble when Qin Keqing dies, so Jia Zhen asks Xifeng to run the funeral (ch. 13). At her father-in-law’s death she manages alone and brings in her stepmother and two stepsisters (ch. 63). When Jia Lian’s secret marriage to You Erjie comes out, Xifeng storms the Ning mansion, weeping and railing in her arms and spitting in her face (ch. 68). After the search of the garden Xichun refuses to keep her maid Ruhua and breaks with the Ning mansion, and the two quarrel (ch. 74)."),
