    bio=("贾珍的儿子，十七八岁，“面目清秀，身材俊俏，轻裘宝带，美服华冠”(第6回)。他来荣府向凤姐借玻璃炕屏，婶侄之间说笑亲昵(第6回)。他和贾蔷替凤姐捉住贾瑞，逼他写了欠契，又泼了他一身屎尿(第12回)。妻子秦可卿死后，父亲替他捐了五品龙禁尉，好让丧礼风光(第13回)。祖父贾敬丧中，他撺掇贾琏偷娶尤二姐，自己也存着私心(第64回)；凤姐大闹宁国府，他跪在地下自己打嘴巴赔罪(第68回)。",
         "Jia Zhen’s son, seventeen or eighteen, handsome and finely dressed (ch. 6). He comes to borrow a glass screen from Xifeng, and aunt and nephew banter familiarly (ch. 6). With Jia Qiang he springs Xifeng’s trap on Jia Rui, forcing an IOU from him and drenching him in filth (ch. 12). When his wife Qin Keqing dies his father buys him a guard’s commission so her funeral can be grander (ch. 13). During his grandfather’s funeral he eggs Jia Lian on to marry You Erjie in secret, with designs of his own (ch. 64); when Xifeng storms the Ning mansion he kneels and slaps his own face to beg her pardon (ch. 68)."),
