    bio=("营缮郎秦业从养生堂抱养的女儿，“生的形容袅娜，性格风流”(第8回)，是贾母“重孙媳中第一个得意之人”(第5回)。宝玉在她房中午睡，梦游太虚幻境，梦中警幻把乳名兼美、字可卿的妹妹许给了他(第5回)。第十回她卧病不起，张太医说她“心性高强，聪明不过”，思虑太过伤了脾。第十三回她托梦给凤姐，嘱咐趁着盛时在祖茔附近多置田庄，以防将来败落，又说“三春过后诸芳尽，各自须寻各自门”；随即传来她的死讯，“合家皆知，无不纳罕，都有些疑心”。宁府为她办了极其奢华的丧事，丫鬟瑞珠触柱而死。",
         "Adopted from a foundling home by the minor official Qin Ye, she grew up graceful and charming (ch. 8), and is Grandmother Jia’s favourite among her great-grandsons’ wives (ch. 5). Baoyu naps in her room and dreams of the Land of Illusion, where the fairy Disenchantment marries him to her own sister, also called Keqing (ch. 5). In chapter 10 she falls ill; the doctor says she is too proud and too clever, and has worried herself sick. In chapter 13 she appears to Xifeng in a dream, urging her to buy land by the family graves while times are good, against the day of ruin; then news comes that she has died, and “the whole household wondered, and had their suspicions”. The Ning mansion gives her a lavish funeral, and her maid Ruizhu dashes her head against a pillar."),
    late=("第一百一十一回，鸳鸯决意殉主时，看见一个女人拿着汗巾作上吊的样子，正是秦可卿；她说自己是太虚幻境里管风情月债的，来引鸳鸯同去。",
          "In chapter 111, as Yuanyang resolves to die, she sees a woman with a sash as if about to hang herself: it is Qin Keqing, who says she keeps the accounts of love in the Land of Illusion and has come to lead Yuanyang there."),
