    bio=("宁府正派玄孙，父母早亡，从小跟着贾珍过活，“比贾蓉生的还风流俊俏”，与贾蓉最相亲厚；因有人说闲话，贾珍才让他搬出宁府另住(第9回)。闹学堂时是他暗中挑唆茗烟出头(第9回)。为了元妃省亲，他到姑苏采买了十二个女孩子，在梨香院教戏(第16—18回)。他和小旦龄官相爱：龄官在蔷薇架下一遍遍地划“蔷”字(第30回)；他买了只会衔旗串戏台的雀儿哄她开心，龄官却说这是拿雀儿比她们，他当场把雀儿放了、笼子拆了(第36回)。",
         "Of the main Ning line, orphaned young and raised in Jia Zhen’s house; even handsomer than Jia Rong, and his closest friend, until gossip makes Jia Zhen move him out (ch. 9). In the school brawl it is he who quietly sets the page Mingyan on (ch. 9). For the Imperial Consort’s visit he goes to Suzhou to buy twelve girls and trains them as an opera troupe at Pear Fragrance Court (chs. 16–18). He and the actress Lingguan are in love: she scratches the character of his name in the earth again and again (ch. 30); he buys her a bird that performs on a toy stage, but when she says it is caged like the girls, he lets it go and tears the cage apart (ch. 36)."),
