    bio=("尤二姐的妹妹，容貌绝色，性情刚烈。贾珍、贾琏想轻薄她，她反客为主，借酒戏骂，把两人弄得“欲近不能，欲远不舍”(第65回)。她说五年前就看中了串戏的柳湘莲，非他不嫁，当众把一根玉簪击作两段，“一句不真，就如这簪子”，从此“非礼不动，非礼不言”(第65—66回)。柳湘莲以祖传的鸳鸯剑为定礼，回京后听说她是宁府里的人，起了疑心，来要回定礼；她在房中听见，摘下剑来，“右手回肘只往项上一横”，自刎而死(第66回)。",
         "Erjie’s sister, dazzlingly beautiful and fierce. When Jia Zhen and Jia Lian try to take liberties, she turns the tables, drinking and mocking them until they can neither come near nor tear themselves away (ch. 65). She declares she has loved the actor-gentleman Liu Xianglian for five years and will marry no one else; snapping a jade hairpin in two, she swears that if she lies she will be like the pin, and from then on behaves with perfect propriety (chs. 65–66). Liu gives his family’s twin swords as a pledge, but back in the capital he hears she belongs to the Ning household, grows suspicious and comes to take the pledge back. Hearing this, she draws the sword and cuts her own throat (ch. 66)."),
