    sub=("贾家旁支的穷子弟", "A poor young man of the Jia clan"),
    bio=("后廊上住的五嫂子的儿子，家境贫寒，“生得着实斯文清秀”(第24回)。宝玉说他“倒象我的儿子”，他便顺口认了宝玉做父亲(第24回)。为了谋个差事，他向舅舅卜世仁赊香料不成，倒是街坊泼皮“醉金刚”倪二借了他银子；他买了冰片麝香送给凤姐，得了在大观园种树的差事(第24回)。他捡到小红丢的手帕，两人借坠儿暗通心意(第24、26回)。",
         "Son of a poor widow of the clan, refined and good-looking (ch. 24). When Baoyu says he looks like his son, Jia Yun promptly adopts Baoyu as his “father” (ch. 24). Looking for work, he is refused credit by his own uncle but lent money by the local tough, the “Drunken Diamond” Ni Er; with it he buys borneol and musk for Xifeng and gets the job of planting trees in the garden (ch. 24). He picks up a handkerchief dropped by the maid Xiaohong, and the two exchange feelings through a go-between (chs. 24, 26)."),
    late=("后来他和贾环、王仁等人串通，要把巧姐卖给外藩(第117—119回)。",
          "Later he joins Jia Huan and Wang Ren in the plot to sell Qiaojie to a foreign prince (chs. 117–119)."),
